    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "id": "8ba54478",
      "metadata": {},
      "source": [
        "**Two clear sources of multicolinearity:**\n",
        "1. Gemini created metrics:\n",
        "    - Example: Common Area Average Appeal & Common Area Avg Finish Quality & Common Area Average Condition\n",
        "    - Better prompting could be applied to improve results, yet not suprised to see correlated results from LLM.\n",
        "2. Street Easy amenities that overlap:\n",
        "    - Example: \"City View\" & \"View\", Garage & Parking, Balcony & Private Outdoor space & Roof Deck\n",
        "    - Many Street Easy amentities are redundent to another or even meaningless to most renters"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "id": "9b435a10",
      "metadata": {},
      "source": [
        "***Proposed resolution:***\n",
        "1. ***Merge Gemini metrics into one score***: avg_natural_light, avg_finish_quality, avg_space_feeling, avg_condition → `apt_quality`; common_avg_* → `common_quality` \n",
        "2. ***Amenity tiering***:(amen_tier_a/b/c) simplified 40+ binary amenity columns. Sums up amentities by tier:\n",
        "    - `amen_tier_a` = premium (pool, washer / dryer, central a/c, gym, etc.)\n",
        "    - `amen_tier_b` = standard (doorman, elevator, dishwasher, package room, etc.)\n",
        "    - `amen_tier_c` = Low signal tags (fios available, view, park, city, etc.)"
      ]
    },
